{
  "description": "One stdout line of an ACP agent in a ready session, and the effects it gives. Each case starts from the same handshake: start {projectDir \"/work/app\", agentCommand [\"agent\"]}, spawned, {\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":1,\"result\":{}} and {\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":2,\"result\":{\"sessionId\":\"s1\",\"models\":{\"currentModelId\":\"m1\"}}}, which must give sessionReady(s1, m1); then the case's line is fed to the same launch. Lines are read with the shared Foundation-matching reader (HK-393) and fields as Swift casts them (HK-403). Only agent_message_chunk and tool_call updates show; thoughts and every other kind are ignored (HK-151). Text lengths count extended grapheme clusters (HK-063).",
  "function": "one agent line in a ready session ↔ AcpAdapter::stdout_line after the standard handshake — input: a line input; expected: [acp effect]",
  "verifiedBy": "DESIGN.md v2.0, v2.2 E. Rust: rust/powerup-core/tests/acp.rs acp_agent_lines_cases runs AcpAdapter; the Swift app plays it through CoreBridge from slice 2.4's bridge ticket (#155).",
  "capturedAgainst": "ACPAdapter.swift at dddf9c6 through a scratch differential harness (Swift 5.9.2, macOS 27.2) that checks every written line, every event and the state each event sees",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "a thought is ignored",
      "input": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"method\":\"session/update\",\"params\":{\"sessionId\":\"s1\",\"update\":{\"sessionUpdate\":\"agent_thought_chunk\",\"content\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"thinking\"}}}}",
      "expected": [],
      "reason": "HK-151: agent_thought_chunk never reaches the reply or the stream."
    },
    {
      "name": "a message chunk streams",
      "input": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"method\":\"session/update\",\"params\":{\"sessionId\":\"s1\",\"update\":{\"sessionUpdate\":\"agent_message_chunk\",\"content\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Hello\"}}}}",
      "expected": [
        {
          "effect": "emit",
          "event": {
            "type": "replyDelta",
            "text": "Hello"
          }
        }
      ],
      "reason": "agent_message_chunk text streams as a reply delta."
    },
    {
      "name": "an empty chunk is dropped",
      "input": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"method\":\"session/update\",\"params\":{\"sessionId\":\"s1\",\"update\":{\"sessionUpdate\":\"agent_message_chunk\",\"content\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"\"}}}}",
      "expected": [],
      "reason": "HK-151: an empty chunk is not a delta."
    },
    {
      "name": "a chunk whose text is not a string is dropped",
      "input": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"method\":\"session/update\",\"params\":{\"sessionId\":\"s1\",\"update\":{\"sessionUpdate\":\"agent_message_chunk\",\"content\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":5}}}}",
      "expected": [],
      "reason": "HK-403: text reads only as a string."
    },
    {
      "name": "a chunk without content is dropped",
      "input": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"method\":\"session/update\",\"params\":{\"sessionId\":\"s1\",\"update\":{\"sessionUpdate\":\"agent_message_chunk\"}}}",
      "expected": [],
      "reason": "No content, nothing to stream."
    },
    {
      "name": "a chunk whose content is not an object is dropped",
      "input": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"method\":\"session/update\",\"params\":{\"sessionId\":\"s1\",\"update\":{\"sessionUpdate\":\"agent_message_chunk\",\"content\":\"Hello\"}}}",
      "expected": [],
      "reason": "HK-403: content reads only as an object."
    },
    {
      "name": "the content type is not checked",
      "input": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"method\":\"session/update\",\"params\":{\"sessionId\":\"s1\",\"update\":{\"sessionUpdate\":\"agent_message_chunk\",\"content\":{\"type\":\"image\",\"text\":\"alt\"}}}}",
      "expected": [
        {
          "effect": "emit",
          "event": {
            "type": "replyDelta",
            "text": "alt"
          }
        }
      ],
      "reason": "Any content with text streams; the type is never compared."
    },
    {
      "name": "a chunk keeps its whitespace",
      "input": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"method\":\"session/update\",\"params\":{\"sessionId\":\"s1\",\"update\":{\"sessionUpdate\":\"agent_message_chunk\",\"content\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" a\\n\\tb \"}}}}",
      "expected": [
        {
          "effect": "emit",
          "event": {
            "type": "replyDelta",
            "text": " a\n\tb "
          }
        }
      ],
      "reason": "Deltas stream as sent; only the final reply is trimmed."
    },
    {
      "name": "the Claude bridge's toolName wins over the title",
      "input": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"method\":\"session/update\",\"params\":{\"sessionId\":\"s1\",\"update\":{\"sessionUpdate\":\"tool_call\",\"toolCallId\":\"t1\",\"title\":\"Read src/a.swift\",\"_meta\":{\"claudeCode\":{\"toolName\":\"Read\"}},\"locations\":[{\"path\":\"/work/app/src/a.swift\"}]}}}",
      "expected": [
        {
          "effect": "emit",
          "event": {
            "type": "toolUse",
            "name": "Read",
            "detail": "a.swift"
          }
        }
      ],
      "reason": "HK-149: the bridge's title is a long phrase, so _meta.claudeCode.toolName names the tool."
    },
    {
      "name": "the title names the tool without a toolName",
      "input": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"method\":\"session/update\",\"params\":{\"sessionId\":\"s1\",\"update\":{\"sessionUpdate\":\"tool_call\",\"toolCallId\":\"t1\",\"title\":\"Edit File\",\"kind\":\"edit\"}}}",
      "expected": [
        {
          "effect": "emit",
          "event": {
